%% expect: Developer pushes a commit|Run the unit and integration tests|Did every check pass|Publish release artifacts|Notify the author on the pull request|Continuous integration|Deployment|no, tests failed|yes, promote the build|Roll back to the previous release
flowchart LR
    Push[Developer pushes a commit] --> Lint[Lint and format check]
    subgraph CI [Continuous integration]
        Lint --> Tests[Run the unit and integration tests]
        Tests --> Gate{Did every check pass?}
    end
    Gate -- no, tests failed --> Notify[Notify the author on the pull request]
    Notify --> Push
    Gate -- yes, promote the build --> Build[Build the signed installer]
    subgraph CD [Deployment]
        Build --> Publish[(Publish release artifacts)]
        Publish --> Canary([Canary rollout to five percent])
        Canary --> Health{Error rate acceptable?}
        Health -->|yes| Full[Full rollout to all users]
        Health -->|no| Back[Roll back to the previous release]
    end
